# Normalisasi line ending lintas platform (Linux, macOS, Windows).
# Prettier memakai LF; tanpa ini Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true) checkout CRLF
# dan `pnpm format:check` gagal.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Biner
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
